# The VM mechanism check (VMM-001 slice 1, headless --test vm-hello). Requests
# nothing: it runs in procmgr's place, from a test initrd only, and uses the
# handles devmgr gives procmgr (the VM creation authority and the test console).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.test.vm-hello"
  version => "1.0.0")
